Open Threads

- Exact date of dYdX Foundation legal incorporation and jurisdiction (Switzerland vs other) — not confirmed by primary source; Phase 2 lists as LOW confidence
- Complete Series A/B/C funding amounts, valuations, and investor allocations — only Series C ($65M, a16z lead) well-documented; earlier rounds need verification
- Exact TGE unlock schedule for team/investor allocations (vesting cliffs, monthly unlocks) — whitepaper mentions 5-year vesting but no detailed schedule verified on-chain
